{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Axis\/Set\/init(rawValue:)"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"title":"init(rawValue:)","roleHeading":"Initializer","symbolKind":"init","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"rawValue","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int8","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Int8V"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4AxisO3SetV8rawValueAEs4Int8V_tcfc"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/axis\/set\/init(rawvalue:)"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates a new option set from the given raw value.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Axis","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Axis\/Set"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"rawValue"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int8","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Int8V"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"rawValue","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The raw value of the option set to create. Each bit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of "},{"code":"rawValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" potentially represents an element of the option set,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though raw values may include bits that are not defined as distinct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values of the "},{"code":"OptionSet","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" type."}],"type":"p